        },
        {
          "doc": "`approve` was called with a negative `expiration_ledger` relative to\\nthe current ledger (SEP-41 requires it to be non-negative and, for a\\nnonzero amount, in the future).",
          "name": "InvalidExpirationLedger",
          "value": 5
        },
        {
          "doc": "A balance or total-supply update would overflow `i128`.",
